# The DHCPACK the builder writes for relayed-request.hex: header copied from the request,
# yiaddr 192.0.2.50, option 53 first, lease times, subnet mask, router, two name servers,
# domain name, the domain search list of RFC 3397's example (on example.test names,
# compressed), the client FQDN answered with flags S and E and RCODEs 255, and option 82
# echoed last.
#
# op 2, htype 1, hlen 6, hops 0
02 01 06 00
# xid
1c 0f fe e1
# secs, flags
00 00 00 00
# ciaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# yiaddr 192.0.2.50
c0 00 02 32
# siaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# giaddr 192.0.2.1
c0 00 02 01
# chaddr
00 00 5e 00 53 03 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
# sname: empty
00*64
# file: empty
00*128
# magic cookie
63 82 53 63
# option 53: DHCPACK
35 01 05
# option 54: server identifier
36 04 c6 33 64 0a
# option 51: lease time 86400
33 04 00 01 51 80
# option 58: renewal time 43200
3a 04 00 00 a8 c0
# option 59: rebinding time 75600
3b 04 00 01 27 50
# option 1: subnet mask
01 04 ff ff ff 00
# option 3: router
03 04 c0 00 02 01
# option 6: domain name servers
06 08 c0 00 02 35 c6 33 64 35
# option 15: domain name
0f 0c 65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65 2e 74 65 73 74
# option 119: domain search: eng.example.test, marketing.example.test (pointer to 4)
77 1e 03 65 6e 67 07 65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65 04 74
65 73 74 00 09 6d 61 72 6b 65 74 69 6e 67 c0 04
# option 81: client FQDN: S and E, RCODEs 255
51 19 05 ff ff 07 68 6f 73 74 2d 30 31 07 65 78
61 6d 70 6c 65 04 74 65 73 74 00
# option 82: relay agent information, echoed
52 10 01 06 00 04 00 0a 00 03 02 06 00 00 5e 00
53 fe
# end
ff
